From: MakOS Project <makos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] config: wrap sys/auxv.h for MakOS

MakOS uses musl getauxval for executable discovery and AArch64 feature probes.
Route sys/auxv.h through Firefox's generated system wrapper so declarations
retain default visibility when source files start under gcc_hidden.h.

diff --git a/config/system-headers.mozbuild b/config/system-headers.mozbuild
--- a/config/system-headers.mozbuild
+++ b/config/system-headers.mozbuild
@@ -1377,7 +1377,7 @@ if CONFIG["MOZ_WAYLAND"]:
         "wayland-util.h",
     ]
 
-if CONFIG["OS_TARGET"] in ("Android", "Linux", "FreeBSD"):
+if CONFIG["OS_TARGET"] in ("Android", "Linux", "FreeBSD", "MakOS"):
     system_headers += [
         "sys/auxv.h",
     ]
